{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAMSUMO</strong> is an indie physics-based multiplayer game where up to 4 players can duke it out in the world's most adorable battle arena! Choose from a selection of <strong>cute</strong>, <u>cool</u>, and <i>kooky</i> hamsters to <strong>BONK YOUR FRIENDS</strong>! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>GO HAM</strong> with a hamster that fits your style! Choose from 8 playable HamSumo fighters, each with their own look and personality!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash the power of the cosmos with <strong>STAR MOVES</strong>! Each hamster has 3 unique Star Moves to experiment with. Learning to use them effectively can really turn the tables on your opponents! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep physics-based movement that is <strong>EASY TO LEARN</strong> and <strong>HARD TO MASTER</strong>! Honing your roly-poly skills will be the difference between victory and defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Play against your friends or CPU opponents in <strong>VERSUS</strong> matches! 1v1 duels, or a full on 4-Player Free For All? The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Captain Ham's perilous journey to Planet Sumo in <strong>ADVENTURE</strong> mode! Play through a new chapter every week!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your experience with unlockable accessories for your hamsters!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2561810?t=1757426321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2561810?t=1757426321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/731afb482485b11910152f404587943b3a99dcc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757426321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati